  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  pageTitle: 
  pageText: 'Humans... so numerous, they wander in daylight, much to our discontent,
    reveling even more in the night with their penchant for loud noises and strange,
    unnatural sounds...



    They shape and rebuild wherever they go, always discontent
    with the status quo. They may call themselves engineers and architects, but a
    truer description for them would be havoc-wreaking.'
