    - target: {fileID: 6169774594209820653, guid: 32668d62e96983d41a07875f67939d77, type: 3}
      propertyPath: pageText
      value: 'No more notes or bottles... I''ll just write on my helmet.



        I
        see Drogo, the chief of Orcs... don''t know what to do next, but I''m heading
        ahead.



        To anyone who finds this, if I die, please grant me some
        honorary titles and lands. I haven''t got children, I think. Just pick a
        lad or a lass that''s hardworking and settle it that way.



        See
        you on the other side, soldier.



        Argh!!!'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
