  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  pageTitle: 
  pageText: "They like to pretend they're brave, yet the mere sight of a sandworm
    would send them trembling.\n\nWith that said, it must be noted that they can
    adapt easily to adverse conditions. \n\nAnd the stronger among them occupy the
    higher social structures... in that sense, we are alike."
