  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 3806d7fd0c8280047ad8102a1ab39edf, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  pageTitle: 
  pageText: "Creativity defines them, with their taste for flowery songs and sunset
    paintings... \n\nThey find solace in these despicable things, seeking refuge
    from the harsh realities of existence. \n\nThey do craft some impressive weaponry,
    although it is believed that their blacksmithing originates from imitations of
    our own craftsmanship... or even worse, dealings and trade with the elves."
